  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/IMG_3069.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>147 fotos de l&#39;homenatge p&ograve;stum que han retut aquest dijous de nit al pub Terra de Castell&oacute; actrius, actors, contacontes, gent de la m&uacute;sica i de l&#39;animaci&oacute;, o la fam&iacute;lia a Maria &Agrave;ngels Ramos Pallar&eacute;s, La Rodam&oacute;n, que va participar en moltes Escoletes i activitats de la biblioteca d&#39;Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenatgepostummariangelsrodamonterracs/img_2945.jpg\" alt=\"img_2945\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenatgepostummariangelsrodamonterracs/img_2946.jpg\" alt=\"img_2946\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenatgepostummariangelsrodamonterracs/img_2948.jpg\" alt=\"img_2948\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenatgepostummariangelsrodamonterracs/img_2950.jpg\" alt=\"img_2950\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenatgepostummariangelsrodamonterracs/img_2951.jpg\" alt=\"img_2951\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenatgepostummariangelsrodamonterracs/img_2952.jpg\" alt=\"img_2952\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenatgepostummariangelsrodamonterracs/img_2953.jpg\" alt=\"img_2953\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenatgepostummariangelsrodamonterracs/img_2955.jpg\" alt=\"img_2955\" style=\"max-width:100%;heigh